WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:05.000
A large double-engined aircraft
just flew into the World Trade Center.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.191
This idea of ramming
an aircraft into a building,

00:00:12.191 --> 00:00:14.152
it wasn’t on
our radar screen.

00:00:17.155 --> 00:00:18.323
I was now

00:00:18.323 --> 00:00:19.824
the national security adviser

00:00:19.824 --> 00:00:20.575
on a day

00:00:20.575 --> 00:00:22.952
of the worst attack
on American territory

00:00:22.952 --> 00:00:24.704
since the war of 1812.

00:00:24.704 --> 00:00:26.497
American 11 757

00:00:26.497 --> 00:00:28.207
possible hijack.
Stop all departures.

00:00:28.207 --> 00:00:29.334
Stop all departures.

00:00:29.334 --> 00:00:30.710
In a crisis like this

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.837
it’s really all-consuming.

00:00:32.837 --> 00:00:35.506
There is a lot that you don’t know,

00:00:35.506 --> 00:00:36.841
and there’s a lot that
you think you know

00:00:36.841 --> 00:00:38.134
that is wrong.

00:00:40.345 --> 00:00:42.680
Vice President Cheney
then turned to me and said,

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.307
The president has authorized

00:00:44.307 --> 00:00:46.934
a shoot-down of an aircraft.”

00:00:46.934 --> 00:00:49.937
It was hijacked and
represented a true threat.

00:00:51.147 --> 00:00:52.899
The president
didn’t have time&lt;

00:00:52.899 --> 00:00:54.108
to go through&lt;

00:00:54.108 --> 00:00:55.193
the pros and cons.

00:00:55.193 --> 00:00:57.236
Every plane that
was in the air

00:00:57.236 --> 00:00:58.780
was a potential missile.

00:01:00.156 --> 00:01:01.199
When 93 went down,

00:01:01.199 --> 00:01:02.784
there was a&lt;
terrible moment where

00:01:02.784 --> 00:01:04.952
we all thought that&lt;
perhaps we’d shot it down.

